  "title": "can 后面跟原形：He can swim，不加 s",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "规则：can 后面跟原样",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "会字后面，动作不变样"
        },
        {
          "id": "g1",
          "kind": "table",
          "rows": [
            [
              "I can swim.",
              "He can swim."
            ],
            [
              "You can swim.",
              "She can swim."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "t1",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "谁会做都一样：can + 动作原样"
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "say": "这节小课只讲一个规则：会字后面的动作词，永远保持原样。"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "g1"
        },
        {
          "say": "看这张表，不管是我、你、他还是她，后面都一样。跟我读。"
        },
        {
          "say": "I can swim. You can swim.",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "say": "He can swim. She can swim.",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "t1"
        },
        {
          "say": "动作词不加尾巴，也不变样子。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "演示两个例子",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "看两个例子"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Peter → He can swim."
        },
        {
          "id": "t2",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Jill → She can ride a bicycle."
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "spotlight": "t1"
        },
        {
          "say": "例子一：彼得会游泳。说他会的时候，游泳还是原样。跟我读。"
        },
        {
          "say": "He can swim. He can swim.",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "t2"
        },
        {
          "say": "例子二：吉尔会骑自行车。说她会的时候，骑还是原样。跟我读。"
        },
        {
          "say": "She can ride a bicycle. She can ride a bicycle.",
          "lang": "en"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "常见错误",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "找一找错在哪"
        },
        {
          "id": "t1",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "✗ He can swims.   ✓ He can swim."
        },
        {
          "id": "t2",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "✗ Do you can swim?   ✓ Can you swim?"
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "spotlight": "t1"
        },
        {
          "say": "错误一：在动作词后面加了尾巴。会字后面不能加，正确的是："
        },
        {
          "say": "He can swim.",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "spotlight": "t2"
        },
        {
          "say": "错误二：问句前面多了一个词。问会不会，直接把会字放在最前面。正确的是："
        },
        {
          "say": "Can you swim?",
          "lang": "en"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "动作歌谣",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "小歌谣 Chant"
        },
        {
          "id": "l1",
          "kind": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "I can swim, you can swim.",
            "He can swim, she can swim.",
            "After can, no s, no s!"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "spotlight": "l1"
        },
        {
          "say": "我们来念一首小歌谣，老师先念，你跟着念。"
        },
        {
          "say": "I can swim, you can swim.",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "say": "He can swim, she can swim.",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "say": "After can, no s, no s!",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "say": "最后一句的意思是：会字后面，动作词不加尾巴。"
        },
        {
          "say": "再跟我念一遍最后一句。"
        },
        {
          "say": "After can, no s, no s!",
          "lang": "en"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
